---
layout: page.njk
title: About Us
permalink: /about/
seoTitle: 'About AI Safety for Italy: Our Mission & Community'
seoDescription: "Learn about AI Safety for Italy's mission to reduce AI risks in Italy through learning, education, and community building across 9 active working groups."
---

<!-- Page hero -->
<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow" data-en="{{ translations.en.nav.about }}" data-it="{{ translations.it.nav.about }}">{{ translations.en.nav.about }}</span>
        <h1 data-en="{{ about.hero.title }}" data-it="{{ about.hero.title_it }}">{{ about.hero.title }}</h1>
        <p class="lede" data-en="{{ about.hero.subtitle }}" data-it="{{ about.hero.subtitle_it }}">{{ about.hero.subtitle }}</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Where we are — animated stylised map of Italy.
     Outline geometry is derived from Natural Earth (public domain) via
     world-atlas, Mercator-projected and simplified into this viewBox.
     The draw-in, fill and dot animations all key off .is-visible, which the
     shared scroll-reveal observer in base.njk adds. That observer applies
     .is-visible immediately under prefers-reduced-motion, and the CSS
     disables the motion in that case, so the map just appears. -->
